abstract: >-
  One-repo from beal-conjecture with honest slice Level26/HonestB0Search/
  from foundations 43735b3. Vendor unchanged db7a556/fea0c393 no nested
  Level26. Includes TwoDescent |Sel2|=1 3*7=21, BSD_MordellWeil ¬IsRankZero,
  Tate 32/928, Mazur 2184, Ribet 32, Kolyvagin Fintype, L/Ω=1/3 1/7,
  Matveev Thm1.4 C1=143186215390 B0=10^6. Lake HonestB0Search green,
  Level26 green, path-requires. Foundations phase-darmon-merel-4413 stays
  43735b3 working repo for last 4 def Props. Concept DOI
  10.5281/zenodo.22379293. Prior software version v11.0.0
  (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22281075).
